     "overview": "Brand Concept — Movement That Connects the World\n\nDelvix represents the continuous movement of goods, information, businesses, and people.\n\nThe brand communicates: Smart Transportation · Global Connectivity · Supply Chain Intelligence · Sustainable Growth · Future Innovation\n\nBrand Personality — Innovative (technology-driven) · Reliable (trusted and dependable) · Global (designed for international markets) · Smart (powered by intelligent solutions) · Sustainable (built for future growth).",
