     "overview": "Main Brand Idea — AERIVO represents freedom, movement and exploration. The brand connects the feeling of travelling through the sky, moving across water and discovering places beyond familiar routes. AERIVO encourages people to step outside their normal journey and experience something new.\n\nSimple brand message: AERIVO helps people explore beyond the ordinary.\n\nBrand Promise — AERIVO provides exciting, reliable and beautifully designed experiences and equipment for modern explorers. The brand combines the excitement of adventure with the confidence of quality, reliability and safety.",
     "solution": "Logo Meaning — The AERIVO icon is an abstract symbol with multiple meanings. The upper shapes can suggest a parachute or wings: freedom, air adventure, courage and new experiences. The overall form can also suggest a fish or movement through water, connecting the brand with ocean travel, surfing, diving, fishing trips and island exploration. The central structure creates the letter A, connecting the symbol directly with the AERIVO name, and gives a feeling of forward movement and direction — progress, discovery and reaching new destinations. The balanced structure creates a sense of trust, stability, confidence and quality. Overall, the AERIVO symbol represents adventure across the sky, sea and unexplored natural destinations.\n\nMeaning of the Name — AERIVO is a created brand name with a modern and international sound. AERI creates an association with air, aviation and open space; VO creates a feeling of voyage, movement and travel. The name is short, memorable and flexible enough for adventure travel services, outdoor products and digital platforms.",
