    "description": "MOVA is a contemporary fashion brand built around movement, self-expression, and individuality. Its philosophy, “Move With Style,” reflects moving forward confidently while embracing change — fashion as a reflection of personality, confidence, lifestyle, and continuous evolution.",
    "featured": false,
