    "caseStudy": {
     "challenge": "Fashion brands live or die on feeling. MOVA needed to express movement, transformation and personal expression in a single mark — premium and refined, yet contemporary enough for everyday clothing — and one identity that works just as well on a clothing label as on a shopping bag, a shopfront or a phone screen.",
     "solution": "Logo Concept — The symbol at the beginning of the logo resembles two opposing yet connected forms, inspired by the shape of a butterfly. A butterfly represents transformation, freedom, beauty, and evolution — concepts that strongly connect with fashion and personal expression. Its symmetrical structure also creates a sense of balance, harmony, and individuality.\n\nThe symbol can additionally be interpreted as two forms moving toward each other, representing connection, motion, and the continuous evolution of style. This interpretation directly supports MOVA’s philosophy of “Move With Style.”\n\nThe custom MOVA wordmark uses clean geometric construction combined with elegant curves and sharp details. The contrast between soft and structured forms creates a balance between fashion-forward creativity and premium sophistication, giving the identity a distinctive and contemporary character.\n\nThe warm terracotta/brown color palette communicates warmth, confidence, authenticity, and refined luxury, while the cream/off-white background creates an elegant contrast and strengthens the premium nature of the brand.\n\nOverall, the MOVA identity represents a modern fashion brand that encourages people to embrace change, express their individuality, and move confidently through life with style.",
     "overview": "About the Brand — MOVA is a contemporary fashion brand built around movement, self-expression, and individuality. The brand believes that fashion is more than what we wear — it is a reflection of personality, confidence, lifestyle, and continuous evolution. Designed for modern individuals who value style, comfort, and authenticity, MOVA brings together contemporary aesthetics and refined simplicity.\n\nThe brand philosophy, “Move With Style,” reflects the idea of moving forward confidently while embracing change and expressing individuality through fashion.",
